[Outscale documentation](https://docs.outscale.com/en/userguide/Subscribing-To-a-Mistral-Service-and-Deploying-it.html)
to deploy a service with the model of your choice.

### Querying the Model (Chat Completion) {#querying-the-model-chat}

Deployed models expose a REST API that you can query using Mistral's SDK or plain HTTP calls.
To run the examples below, you will need to set the following environment variables:
